<title>SPAIN: Spain's Dragados details Q1 results.</title>
<headline>Spain's Dragados details Q1 results.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Details of group results for</p>
<p>Spanish building company Dragados y Construcciones in billions</p>
<p>of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Turnover				   98.29   vs   94.66</p>
<p> Pretax profit			     2.10   vs    2.05</p>
<p> Net taxed				   1.86   vs    1.74</p>
<p> Minorities				  0.23   vs    0.14</p>
<p> Group attributable profit	     1.63   vs    1.61</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, +341 585 2160</p>
